Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "PedestrianSteppingIntoTrafficAtNight" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 ;
    :hasActor :pedestrian1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :rainyNight ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:pedestrian1 a :Pedestrian .
:rainyNight a :RainyCondition, :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Pedestrian unexpectedly entering the road from behind a vehicle at night in rainy conditions" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: PedestrianCollisionRisk caused by a pedestrian stepping into the vehicle path during reduced visibility (night/rain) and occluded sightlines.
Severity Score: 0.95